<title>EGYPT: Bomb hoax delays Paris-Cairo flight.</title>
<headline>Bomb hoax delays Paris-Cairo flight.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb hoax in Paris held up an EgyptAir plane for about 15 hours on Sunday evening, Cairo airport sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Airbus was to have taken off at 6.15 p.m. Paris time (1715 GMT) but will now arrive in Cairo at 3 p.m. local (1300 GMT), they said.</p>
<p>The French authorities disembarked the 325 passengers and searched the plane after an anonymous telephone caller said there was a bomb on the plane. They found nothing.</p>
</text>
